    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/e5fb763021aa0e33533f2b77ed8ae323.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/e5fb763021aa0e33533f2b77ed8ae323.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/e5fb763021aa0e33533f2b77ed8ae323.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>Postmortal Plane</strong>, a realm that exists after death. Your soul has been reborn here by\u00a0<strong>Elyir</strong>, the goddess of light and order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through varied environments from a forest cloaked in darkness to a swamp filled with the corpses of dead gods. Delve into decrepit dungeons and infested dens to find glory and loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist Elyir\u00a0in piecing together a forgotten past and reestablishing some semblance of society in her image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/39c13fe74948710eddde3e44742cf423.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/39c13fe74948710eddde3e44742cf423.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/39c13fe74948710eddde3e44742cf423.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect mountains of weapons, armour, accessories and treasures. Customise your build to maximise the synergies between your equipped items \u2013 becoming overpowered is the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/8ae6f6e5f00439113b724f715a146659.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/8ae6f6e5f00439113b724f715a146659.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/8ae6f6e5f00439113b724f715a146659.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangers lurk in every corner of the world, and threaten to uproot an uneasy peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head into battle and wield a variety of armaments from greatswords and pikes to bows and staffs. There are loads of options to cater to many combat play-styles, be it up close and ferocious or sneaky and calculated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/18a510e3539b06b799cf45a95743384b.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/18a510e3539b06b799cf45a95743384b.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/18a510e3539b06b799cf45a95743384b.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the only one<strong> Elyir</strong>\u00a0has brought here - there are others like you out there. You can build positive and negative relationships with every character you encounter, with unique bonuses and drawbacks. You can befriend them, date them and bring them along for the journey, or just straight up kill them and take their belongings... if you want to do that.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/e5fb763021aa0e33533f2b77ed8ae323.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/e5fb763021aa0e33533f2b77ed8ae323.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/e5fb763021aa0e33533f2b77ed8ae323.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>Postmortal Plane</strong>, a realm that exists after death. Your soul has been reborn here by\u00a0<strong>Elyir</strong>, the goddess of light and order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure through varied environments from a forest cloaked in darkness to a swamp filled with the corpses of dead gods. Delve into decrepit dungeons and infested dens to find glory and loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist Elyir\u00a0in piecing together a forgotten past and reestablishing some semblance of society in her image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/39c13fe74948710eddde3e44742cf423.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/39c13fe74948710eddde3e44742cf423.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/39c13fe74948710eddde3e44742cf423.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect mountains of weapons, armour, accessories and treasures. Customise your build to maximise the synergies between your equipped items \u2013 becoming overpowered is the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/8ae6f6e5f00439113b724f715a146659.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/8ae6f6e5f00439113b724f715a146659.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/8ae6f6e5f00439113b724f715a146659.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangers lurk in every corner of the world, and threaten to uproot an uneasy peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head into battle and wield a variety of armaments from greatswords and pikes to bows and staffs. There are loads of options to cater to many combat play-styles, be it up close and ferocious or sneaky and calculated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/18a510e3539b06b799cf45a95743384b.poster.avif?t=1754755312\" width=960 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/18a510e3539b06b799cf45a95743384b.webm?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3012750/extras/18a510e3539b06b799cf45a95743384b.mp4?t=1754755312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the only one<strong> Elyir</strong>\u00a0has brought here - there are others like you out there. You can build positive and negative relationships with every character you encounter, with unique bonuses and drawbacks. You can befriend them, date them and bring them along for the journey, or just straight up kill them and take their belongings... if you want to do that.</p>",
